### RBAC / Authorization Tests — PravahOS
### Tests for role-based access control
###
### Setup: run auth.http to create admin, compliance_officer, and department_manager users first.
### Then login as each role below and test access.

# -------------------------------------------------------
# RBAC 1: ADMIN — all access
# -------------------------------------------------------

### Login as admin
POST http://localhost:8000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@pravah.in",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### Admin: review MAP (allowed — admin has full access)
POST http://localhost:8000/maps/{{map_id}}/review
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "approve"
}

### Admin: list regulations (allowed)
GET http://localhost:8000/regulations/

### Admin: generate report (allowed)
GET http://localhost:8000/reports/{{regulation_id}}/report


# -------------------------------------------------------
# RBAC 2: COMPLIANCE OFFICER — can review but not admin
# -------------------------------------------------------

### Login as compliance officer
POST http://localhost:8000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "compliance@pravah.in",
  "password": "compliance123"
}

### Compliance officer: review MAP (allowed)
POST http://localhost:8000/maps/{{map_id}}/review
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "approve"
}

### Compliance officer: list regulations (allowed)
GET http://localhost:8000/regulations/


# -------------------------------------------------------
# RBAC 3: DEPARTMENT MANAGER — read-only on reviews
# -------------------------------------------------------

### Login as department manager
POST http://localhost:8000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "manager@pravah.in",
  "password": "manager123"
}

### Department manager: review MAP (expect 403 Forbidden)
POST http://localhost:8000/maps/{{map_id}}/review
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "approve"
}

### Department manager: list regulations (allowed)
GET http://localhost:8000/regulations/

### Department manager: get own profile (allowed)
GET http://localhost:8000/auth/me


# -------------------------------------------------------
# RBAC 4: UNAUTHENTICATED — denied everywhere
# -------------------------------------------------------

### Unauthenticated: list regulations (expect 401)
GET http://localhost:8000/regulations/

### Unauthenticated: review MAP (expect 401)
POST http://localhost:8000/maps/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/review
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "approve"
}

### Unauthenticated: get report (expect 401)
GET http://localhost:8000/reports/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/report
